X08A01 ~r~The trucks are burning. Finish off the escort before they regroup.
X08A02 ~y~Hamid (radio):~w~ Hold. Let me watch the road. Nothing else is moving.
X08B01 ~r~Bikes coming up the road behind the convoy!
X08R01 ~y~Hamid (radio):~w~ My runner left two more rockets by the rocks. Make them count.
